an","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.inputBinding"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","bindings","inputBindings","itemSeparator"],"description":"Join the array elements into a single string with the elements separated\nby itemSeparator.","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.inputBinding"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","bindings","inputBindings","valueFrom"],"description":". If valueFrom is a constant string value, use this as the value.\n. If valueFrom is an expression, evaluate the expression to yield the\n  actual value to use to build the command line.\n. If the value of the associated input parameter is null, valueFrom is\n  not evaluated and nothing is added to the command line.","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.inputBinding"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","bindings","inputBindings","position"],"description":". The zero-based sorting key.\n. The value can be an integer or a string.\n. If the value is a string then it should be an expression that evaluates\n  to a single integer value or null.","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.inputBinding"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","bindings","inputBindings","prefix"],"description":"Command line prefix to add before the value.","schema_type":"string","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.inputBinding"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","config"],"description":"Hardware requirements and configuration properties for executing the\nprocess.","schema_type":"object","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.executionUnitContainer"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","config","jobTimeout"],"description":"Timeout delay for a job execution (in seconds)","schema_type":"number","sources":["bblocks://ogc.api.processes.part2.v1.schemas.executionUnitContainer"]},{"path":["_oneOf","1","_then","value","config","storageOutputsMin